<title>KUWAIT: KUWAIT AIR CARGO RISES 18 PCT IN JULY YR/YR.</title>
<headline>KUWAIT AIR CARGO RISES 18 PCT IN JULY YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-08-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo handled by Kuwait's international airport in July rose 18 percent to 13,467 tonnes compared to July 1996, official figures obtained on Saturday show.</p>
<p>The figures compiled by the Directorate Genral of Civil Aviation showed a two percent rise in passengers to 383,893.</p>
<p>The national flag carrier Kuwait Airways Corp. (KAC) handled 60 percent of passengers and 70 percent of cargo in July 1997.</p>
</text>
